// New feature (Ultimate No Mercy): save_restore (mod/src/save.c), the mod's function at 0x810F44FC.
// Native C++ in place of Stage 1's translation of it, exactly as the random tester proved it against that translation
// (200,000 random tests, no difference, every instruction reached), with the game's bindings (tools/aot/mod_native.py).
